  ],
  "note": "This formula makes the whole signed residual E vanish identically (up to floating-point round-off) at every point inside the chi support. It reduces to the published source-only B(r) at u=0. A successor should verify that after the first field stage the stored z values shift closer to the targets, and that the LEFT family's large-|r| row (r=-1) is untouched because chi_r=0 there. No full PDE estimate is implied by this local algebraic cancellation."
